  "description": "Moonshot AI provider (Kimi) for Zonit.Extensions.Ai library.\nProvides access to Moonshot's Kimi models with chat and completion capabilities.\n\nModels included:\n- Moonshot V1 8K: Fast responses with 8K context\n- Moonshot V1 32K: Extended 32K context window\n- Moonshot V1 128K: Long context up to 128K tokens\n\nFeatures:\n- OpenAI-compatible API format\n- Full streaming support\n- Optimized for Chinese and English language tasks",
